'''Duplex''' is an {{Pink|'''Ultimate'''}} [[Ultimate Enchantment|Enchantment]] that grants a second arrow that deals a portion of the main arrow's damage and inflicts {{dmg|fire damage}} upon an enemy for a limited amount of time. It can be applied to [[Bows]].

== Obtaining ==
The {{Ench|Duplex}} [[Enchantment]] can be obtained in various ways:
