{{Item|Enchanted Book|enchant=Duplex}} can be combined on an {{Item|Anvil}} up to {{Ench|Duplex V}}.

=== Bazaar ===
The {{Ench|Duplex}} [[Ultimate Enchantment|Enchantment]] can be traded through the [[Bazaar]].
