== Trivia ==
*{{Ench|Duplex}} is the only [[Enchantment]] that has had its name changed more than once.
**It was initially called {{LightPurple|'''As Per My Last Email'''}}, before being renamed to {{LightPurple|'''Don't Tell Me Twice'''}}, and finally being called {{LightPurple|'''Reiterate'''}} in the API.

